
Lethathamo ha-ho-fihla: ['product'] etsa: {
	>> total := 1.
	uena e-ngoe-le-e-ngoe: { :index :element
		total ngata-ka: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Lethathamo ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
Sephetho ngola: a product, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (Lethathamo ← 2 ; 4 ; 8) product, mola-o-mocha. 
Sephetho ngola: (Lethathamo ← -2 ; 10) product, mola-o-mocha. 
Sephetho ngola: (Lethathamo ← 0.5 ; -2) product, mola-o-mocha. 
